  "bodyHash": "7BbYe9ZDf/4=",
  "content": "<p>这个资源包将Create模组中所有铜制品的材质恢复为旧版纹理，包括脚手架、铜制桌布、所有流体物品、铜瓦片等众多内容！如果你觉得新版材质不尽如人意，可以使用这个资源包将所有铜材质回滚至经典样式！<br><br>当前支持的方块：<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; - 所有流体相关方块（如流体管道）<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1210517/description_10367948-4d11-4a22-b47d-d056c36ae26a.png\"></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; - 所有铜建材方块及其氧化变种<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1210517/description_42d7c03f-7da3-40b4-a6aa-5ee94311db86.png\"></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; - 所有含铜元素的方块（如库存连接器/显示连接器）<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1210517/description_2199746f-b447-459f-8006-aa72b91632ba.png\"></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; - 采用铜材质的新方块（如桌布/股票行情器）<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1210517/description_535a32c1-7d67-462c-b399-537bc0650d84.png\"><br><br>当前支持的物品：<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; - 所有方块的物品形态<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1210517/description_8bf2bd6c-2804-4d5e-8d42-4c1ccb747d5e.png\"></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; - 新添加的含铜物品（如信号发射器）<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1210517/description_97d061bd-6321-47cd-b4be-43c0d8099fe7.png\"></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; - 所有铜制品（如铜板）<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1210517/description_23f60fc3-db86-4a24-bc78-e13c2e4cfb61.png\"></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; - 土豆炮<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1210517/description_d09d3df0-af24-46a0-b41f-c8b1f3da5e82.png\"></p><p>希望您喜欢这个材质包！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>另请关注：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/create-new-copper-stuffs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create: 新版铜制品材质</a></p>",
